 "html": "<div class=\"bg-watermark container\">\n    \n    \n<div class=\"row\">\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: underline;\">CHILD DEVELOPMENT CENTRE</h1>\n<br>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center; text-decoration: underline;\">SCREENING FOR NEURODEVELOPMENT OF INFANTS AND CHILDREN</h4>\n<br>\n<h4 style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Risk factors for abnormal development in babies and children</h4>\n\n<ul>\n    <li>Newborn problems (prematurity, low birthm apgars with asphyxia, admission to hospital as a newborn)</li>\n    <li>HIV/AIDS</li>\n    <li>Infections (Meningitis, Cerebral malaria)</li>\n    <li>Syndromes and conditions (Down's Fatal Alcohol, Spina bifida)</li>\n    <li>Deafness in parents</li>\n    <li>Nutritional problem (Kwashirkor, Marasmus, FTT)</li>\n    <li>Previous head trauma or near drawning</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If any of these factors are present in a child, it is important to actively look for development that is now normal</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-weight: 700;\">NEURODEVELOPMENT ASSESSMENT</h2>    \n\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"display: flex;\" class=\"row\">\n\n    <div style=\"width:70%\" class=\"col-8\">\n        <h4 style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Abnormal at any Age</h4>\n        <p>Head circumference too small in relation to body weight</p>\n        <p>Head circumference too big in relation to body weight</p>\n        <p>Weakness or stiffness of limbs or body</p>\n        <p>Seizures of fits NOT associated with fever</p>\n        <p>Child lost a previously acquired milestone</p>\n        <p>Example - xcould sit unsupported, cannot sit any more</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"width:15%; text-align: center;\" class=\"col-2\">\n        <h4 style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">YES</h4>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"width:15%; text-align: center;\" class=\"col-2\">\n        <h4 style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">NO</h4>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"display: flex;\" class=\"row\">\n    <div style=\"width:70%\" class=\"col-8\">\n        <h4 style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">At 9 Months</h4>\n        <p>Sitting without support</p>\n        <p>Moving limbs equally/The same</p>\n        <p>Infant can roll from abdomen to back</p>\n        <p>And from back to abdomen</p>\n        <p>Infant reaches out for objects and can hold objects in hand</p>\n        <p>Child turns to you when called by his/her name</p>\n        <p>Child makes speech sounds</p>\n        <p>Child watches a moving object</p>\n        <p>Child squinting</p>\n        <p>Smiles and interacts with care giver</p>\n        <p>Understands No</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"width:15%; text-align: center;\" class=\"col-2\">\n        <h4 style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">YES</h4>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"width:15%; text-align: center;\" class=\"col-2\">\n        <h4 style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">NO</h4>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"display: flex;\" class=\"row\">\n    <div style=\"width:70%\" class=\"col-8\">\n        <h4 style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">At 18 Months</h4>\n        <p>Walking without support</p>\n        <p>Moving all limbs at the same time</p>\n        <p>Can pick up small objects (Like a bean) with fingers</p>\n        <p>Say at least one word with meaning</p>\n        <p>Understand simple instructions at least with meaning</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"width:15%; text-align: center;\" class=\"col-2\">\n        <h4 style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">YES</h4>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        \n    </div>\n    <div style=\"width:15%; text-align: center;\" class=\"col-2\">\n        <h4 style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">NO</h4>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        \n    </div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"display: flex;\" class=\"row\">\n    <div style=\"width:70%\" class=\"col-8\">\n        <h4 style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">At 2.5 Years</h4>\n        <p>Can hold a cup and drink from it</p>\n        <p>Can feed with a spoon</p>\n        <p>Enjoys interaction with parents and plays with other children</p>\n        <p>Using two words sentences</p>\n        <p>Understand single command like \"sit down\"</p>\n        <p>Child talks with parents but only them undertands child's speech</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"width:15%; text-align: center;\" class=\"col-2\">\n        <h4 style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">YES</h4>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        \n    </div>\n    <div style=\"width:15%; text-align: center;\" class=\"col-2\">\n        <h4 style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">NO</h4>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        \n    </div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"display: flex;\" class=\"row\">\n    <div style=\"width:70%\" class=\"col-8\">\n        <h4 style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">At 5 Years</h4>\n        <p>Can run and kick a ball</p>\n        <p>Can walk up and down stairs without help</p>\n        <p>Can use knife and fork whwn eating</p>\n        <p>Can dress and undress himself / herself</p>\n        <p>Toilet trained</p>\n        <p>Speech can be understood by strangers</p>\n        <p>Parent concerned that their child not speaking like other children his/her age</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"width:15%; text-align: center;\" class=\"col-2\">\n        <h4 style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">YES</h4>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"width:15%; text-align: center;\" class=\"col-2\">\n        <h4 style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">NO</h4>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n        <p><input type=\"checkbox\"></p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n    <h4 style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">At 6 Years</h4>\n    <p>Child shows abnormal behaviour or behaviours - aggression or violence to himself/ herself or to other people, very impulsive</p>\n</div>\n\n<br><br>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\">PLEASE REFER THIS CHILD TO THE CHILD DEVELOPMENT CENTRE (CDC)</h4>\n\n</div>",
